# Conformance probe pack for `rest` as the last line of an item of an outer
# `rest` group (spec 0.21 ruling 10), most significant bit first. Public. No
# kinds.
#
#   items       items to the end of the message: qty in 8 bits, then subs to
#               the end of the message (val in 8 bits each). The first item
#               takes the whole message, so an outer list of more than one
#               item does not encode.
format     conformance-extents-outer
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.items rest
  field  probe.qty  8  uint
  group  probe.subs rest
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
